      "writtenOn": "2023-02-07T18:13:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a good point. I guess I was assuming that conflating the two was intentional in this case because `image_to_use` was used to represent `ImageType` throughout the code. I\u0027ve separated those two out now so we have `imagetype_to_use` and `apptype_to_use` where `ImageType` is always `RW` or `RO` and `ApplicationType` is `TEST` or `PRODUCTION`. \n\nThoughts?",
